<%# The one-time upgrade nudge after a free account's first signed document
    (D50). Armed by Quotas.arm_first_completion_prompt, shown to that
    account's administrators until one of them dismisses it.

    It IS the product's upgrade card — shared/_upgrade_cta, with its own words
    and a dismiss × — rather than a second copy of it, so the next restyle of
    that card reaches the dashboard too. The button uses the shared
    upgrade_cta_path helper, so it lands on billing where billing exists and on
    the usage page otherwise: never on a refusal, never on a dead link. %>
<% if FirstCompletionPrompt.for(account: current_account, user: current_user) %>
  <div data-first-completion-prompt>
    <%= render 'shared/upgrade_cta',
               title: t('first_completion_prompt_title'),
               body: t('first_completion_prompt_body', limit: Quotas::Limits::FREE_COMPLETIONS_PER_MONTH),
               class: 'mb-6',
               dismiss_path: first_completion_prompt_path,
               dismiss_data: { first_completion_dismiss: true } %>
  </div>
<% end %>
